    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i already tried talking to them and it was just a bunch of scripted responses. they weren't even helpful, it felt like they were just stallin for time. if they really are trying to push me out, what kind of stuff should i be doing to protect myself? like, are there ways to move my money or manage my accounts so they cant keep messing with me or \"liquidating\" what i have left?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
