      "content": "the problem is if i just move everything at once, it might trigger more \"security flags\" or even more fees while they try to lock me out. i need to be more strategic about it. is there a way to mask my movements or shift funds out in a way that doesn't tip them off that i've caught on to what they're doing? i need to stay under the radar until i can get everything out safely.",
